<section class="py-16 bg-[#f7f9fb]">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-3xl">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-base mt-2">Everything you need to know about TeamFlow and our features.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="accordion-item active">
        <button class="accordion-header" aria-expanded="true">
          <span>How does TeamFlow compare to Jira?</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined accordion-icon">expand_more</span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-body">
          TeamFlow is built specifically for modern speed and transparency. Unlike traditional tools, TeamFlow features zero-latency UI, automatic cross-team roadmap syncing, and integrated documentation without complex administration overhead.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="accordion-item">
        <button class="accordion-header" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>How does the 14-day free trial work?</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined accordion-icon">expand_more</span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-body">
          You get full unlimited access to all Pro features for 14 days. No credit card is required to sign up. At the end of the trial, you can select a plan that suits your team or seamlessly switch to our free tier.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="accordion-item">
        <button class="accordion-header" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>Can we import our data from Jira or Trello?</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined accordion-icon">expand_more</span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-body">
          Yes! We offer 1-click automatic data migration importers for Jira, Trello, Asana, and Linear. All your tasks, history, tags, and attachments are preserved.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="accordion-item">
        <button class="accordion-header" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>Is there a mobile app available?</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined accordion-icon">expand_more</span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-body">
          Yes, TeamFlow is available on iOS, Android, and Web. All your activity and notifications sync in real-time across all devices.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="accordion-item">
        <button class="accordion-header" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>Does TeamFlow offer a free plan?</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined accordion-icon">expand_more</span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-body">
          Yes, our Starter plan is completely free forever for small teams up to 5 members with basic board tracking and storage.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

